# 201: Branch-Based AzerothCore Versioning

## Status
- [x] In Progress (implementation complete, testing pending)
- [ ] Completed

## Current Behavior

The azerothcore script clones a single hardcoded source:
- Repository: `liyunfan1223/azerothcore-wotlk`
- Branch: `Playerbot`
- Modules: mod-eluna, mod-aoe-loot, mod-grownup, mod-playerbots

This works for the current mod-ale/playerbots architecture but is incompatible
with the wow-chat-1 Lua scripts which were designed for:
- Original AzerothCore (circa June 2023)
- Eluna (not mod-ale)
- No playerbots module

## Intended Behavior

Support multiple version profiles via `--profile` flag:

```bash
./scripts/azerothcore install all --profile beta    # June 2023 compatible
./scripts/azerothcore install all --profile alpha   # Latest experimental
./scripts/azerothcore install all --profile release # Stable playerbots
```

### Version Profiles

| Profile | Repository | Branch/Commit | Modules | Purpose |
|---------|------------|---------------|---------|---------|
| beta    | azerothcore/azerothcore-wotlk | Tag ~June 2023 | mod-eluna only | wow-chat-1 compatibility |
| alpha   | liyunfan1223/azerothcore-wotlk | Playerbot HEAD | all current | experimental features |
| release | liyunfan1223/azerothcore-wotlk | Playerbot (pinned) | all current | stable playerbots |
| gamma   | TBD | TBD | TBD | converse design experiments |

### Profile Storage

Each profile gets its own:
- `source-{profile}/` - AzerothCore source
- `build-{profile}/` - Build artifacts
- `installed-files-{profile}/` - Binaries and configs

Shared across profiles:
- `data-files/` - DBC, maps, vmaps, mmaps (version-independent)
- `mysql/` - Database (may need migration scripts between profiles)

## Suggested Implementation Steps

1. Add profile definitions to script header as associative arrays
2. Add `--profile` argument parsing
3. Modify directory paths to include profile suffix
4. Update clone commands to use profile-specific repos/branches
5. Add profile-specific module lists
6. Create profile switching command: `./scripts/azerothcore switch <profile>`
7. Document profile differences

## Technical Approach

```bash
-- Profile definitions
declare -A PROFILE_REPO=(
    ["beta"]="https://github.com/azerothcore/azerothcore-wotlk.git"
    ["alpha"]="https://github.com/liyunfan1223/azerothcore-wotlk.git"
    ["release"]="https://github.com/liyunfan1223/azerothcore-wotlk.git"
)

declare -A PROFILE_BRANCH=(
    ["beta"]="master"
    ["alpha"]="Playerbot"
    ["release"]="Playerbot"
)

declare -A PROFILE_COMMIT=(
    ["beta"]="<commit-hash-from-june-2023>"
    ["alpha"]=""  # HEAD
    ["release"]="<pinned-stable-commit>"
)

declare -A PROFILE_MODULES=(
    ["beta"]="mod-eluna"
    ["alpha"]="mod-eluna mod-aoe-loot mod-grownup mod-playerbots"
    ["release"]="mod-eluna mod-aoe-loot mod-grownup mod-playerbots"
)
```

